{"3643600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Providence", "steam_appid": 3643600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> “The asylum was abandoned. The horrors were not.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Providence</strong> is a psychological horror exploration game set in the ruins of a long-forgotten asylum. You play as Finley “Finn” Clarke, an urban explorer drawn into a place where reality bends, memories twist, and something unnatural lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting world where every shadow tells a story. Solve layered puzzles, interact with objects in immersive ways, and uncover secrets buried deep within the asylum’s walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Perspective, Your Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the asylum in both First Person and Third Person modes. Immerse yourself in the darkness up close or gain a broader view of your surroundings as you search for answers and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/95eeb8c0741cfd6d1d94de046cd82c58.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/95eeb8c0741cfd6d1d94de046cd82c58.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/95eeb8c0741cfd6d1d94de046cd82c58.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your environment in tactile, physical ways. Doors, drawers, and devices aren’t just props—they’re part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/24a00e081573f69a5ae17deed03c80c3.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/24a00e081573f69a5ae17deed03c80c3.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/24a00e081573f69a5ae17deed03c80c3.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum changes as you play. Rooms shift, paths appear or disappear, and familiar places warp based on your actions. The world responds to you—sometimes subtly, sometimes not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8bd55ee699725f23a82f95487f932162.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8bd55ee699725f23a82f95487f932162.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8bd55ee699725f23a82f95487f932162.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search, collect, and use key items to unlock deeper paths—and deeper truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/b2ec05b8a6aa227c29f7144945c6854f.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/b2ec05b8a6aa227c29f7144945c6854f.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/b2ec05b8a6aa227c29f7144945c6854f.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through atmospheric, logic-driven challenges that reveal fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/eea6adb28f0d776c9598f8f3b4660350.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/eea6adb28f0d776c9598f8f3b4660350.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/eea6adb28f0d776c9598f8f3b4660350.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of richly detailed spaces, from decaying hospital wards to overgrown courtyards and sealed-off research wings. Every area is hand-crafted to tell a story through atmosphere, sound, and environmental detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0e3469663e5d754a058a467b4376d874.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0e3469663e5d754a058a467b4376d874.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0e3469663e5d754a058a467b4376d874.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Horrors Within</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The patients never left. Encounter tormented spirits, hostile entities, and the twisted results of Dr. Elias Voss's forbidden experiments. Use light, resourcefulness, and determination to survive the horrors that still roam the halls of Providence</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3d6425cb308efc20403393a727758f12.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3d6425cb308efc20403393a727758f12.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3d6425cb308efc20403393a727758f12.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're Never Truly Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contact is Claire, a voice on the walkie-talkie. Sometimes she answers. Sometimes… something else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is watching. Will you uncover its truth—or be consumed by it?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> “The asylum was abandoned. The horrors were not.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Providence</strong> is a psychological horror exploration game set in the ruins of a long-forgotten asylum. You play as Finley “Finn” Clarke, an urban explorer drawn into a place where reality bends, memories twist, and something unnatural lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting world where every shadow tells a story. Solve layered puzzles, interact with objects in immersive ways, and uncover secrets buried deep within the asylum’s walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Perspective, Your Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the asylum in both First Person and Third Person modes. Immerse yourself in the darkness up close or gain a broader view of your surroundings as you search for answers and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/95eeb8c0741cfd6d1d94de046cd82c58.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/95eeb8c0741cfd6d1d94de046cd82c58.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/95eeb8c0741cfd6d1d94de046cd82c58.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your environment in tactile, physical ways. Doors, drawers, and devices aren’t just props—they’re part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/24a00e081573f69a5ae17deed03c80c3.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/24a00e081573f69a5ae17deed03c80c3.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/24a00e081573f69a5ae17deed03c80c3.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum changes as you play. Rooms shift, paths appear or disappear, and familiar places warp based on your actions. The world responds to you—sometimes subtly, sometimes not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8bd55ee699725f23a82f95487f932162.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8bd55ee699725f23a82f95487f932162.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8bd55ee699725f23a82f95487f932162.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search, collect, and use key items to unlock deeper paths—and deeper truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/b2ec05b8a6aa227c29f7144945c6854f.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/b2ec05b8a6aa227c29f7144945c6854f.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/b2ec05b8a6aa227c29f7144945c6854f.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through atmospheric, logic-driven challenges that reveal fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/eea6adb28f0d776c9598f8f3b4660350.poster.avif?t=1784709179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"ht