/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3d6425cb308efc20403393a727758f12.webm?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3d6425cb308efc20403393a727758f12.mp4?t=1784709179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're Never Truly Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contact is Claire, a voice on the walkie-talkie. Sometimes she answers. Sometimes… something else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is watching. Will you uncover its truth—or be consumed by it?</p>", "short_description": "A psychological horror exploration game where you investigate a long-abandoned asylum, solve environmental puzzles, uncover dark secrets, and make choices that shape the outcome. Communicate through your walkie-talkie, navigate shifting spaces, and confront the horrors that still linger within.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/00b931b9b91ca1011c7746ab49871685cd9fd1e7/header.jpg?t=1784709179", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/a053a978aadbc06e52a9b4bdbce1ba644d4e279f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784709179", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/a053a978aadbc06e52a9b4bdbce1ba644d4e279f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784709179", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00GHz Quad cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 1030 or equiv<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Basic<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> No</li></ul>", "rec